<title>ISRAEL: Osem 3Q net 20.66 million shekels.</title>
<headline>Osem 3Q net 20.66 million shekels.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Osem Investments Ltd reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			   Q3 96	Q3 95	 9-MTH 96    9-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		  317,827    300,692     923,687     874,646</p>
<p>Operating profit	23,962     28,309	66,822	75,047</p>
<p>Net Profit		20,663     17,781	53,128	51,763</p>
<p>($1 = 3.25 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
